// Clue Name :
"P594476466" "The kidnapped woman's story"
// DetailString :
"P402481768" "The woman you rescued from the Vahzilok told you:<br><br>'They approached me because of my money, and because of my illness. You see, I'm dying of cancer. This strange Vahzilok said he could give me eternal life! And all he wanted was the bulk of my fortune!<br><br>'I was desperate, so I gave in. But that was before I knew what they wanted to do to me. They wanted to turn me into a zombie, a walking corpse!'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3652100487" "Several wealthy citizens have disappeared in the last couple of days. That's hardly unusual in this town, but this time no ransom notes have been delivered. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want you to investigate these disappearances, {HeroName}.</A> I have a bad feeling that those people are in serious trouble."
// AcceptString :
"P3341008947" "Investigate the disappearances"
// SendOffString :
"P3192920835" "One more thing: all of the missing people had fatal illnesses. That connection has to mean something, but I can't figure out what!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1110135723" "Rescue the missing citizens"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1318554283" "You must do everything in your power to rescue those missing people."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3036308088" "Sick laughter echoes in the distance."

