"P3670135026" "Rescue the last person!"
// InteractBeginString :
"P856364347" ""
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3549357268" "They said they'd cure me! Hah! They wanted to turn me into a zombie!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage2 
