// IntroString :
"P3740305276" "As a new hero, you should know about those who have come before you. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I think you need to learn about the fallen heroes of Paragon City.</A> It will be a short history lesson, but an important one."
// AcceptString :
"P4180457119" "Learn about the fallen heroes of Paragon City"
// SendOffString :
"P411136916" "Go read the plaque under the statue of Atlas. He was a great man, and the city remains thankful to him to this day. Atlas Park is named in his honor, you know."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P81825613" "Read Atlas' plaque"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2355194959" "You should read the plaque under Atlas' statue."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1655844232" "You learned some of Paragon City's history."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P453563425" "Atlas was a great man. He protected the city from a devastating surprise attack in 1941 by the 5th Column. Without his sacrifice, who knows how many lives might have been lost? I've noticed many people pause in the shadow of his great statue; it's as if they feel safer there."

